    "explanation": "The test is healthy: the split is 49.9% treatment (SRM check: p = 0.553), it reached its planned sample and ran its full 14 days. Paywall conversion moved −7.5% (95% CI −12.5% to −2.5%, p = 0.003), for new and returning users alike (New −7.1%, Returning −7.9%). A bigger upfront price scares off people who were ready to pay monthly. A clean negative result is a result: the right call is to stop, not to keep testing until it turns green.",
